// Codex — the scrambled Ask Jeeves set (tier J). Twenty fragments, unlocked
// for Broken Ask Jeeves in `Jeeves Glitch` (beats/malware.loom). The upload ran
// over the Valley's old DSL line and the files arrived with their key words
// shuffled: every word wrapped in a `/word/ marker belongs in one of the other
// marked slots of the same fragment (unmarked words are correct). The coded
// originals are hidden around the house; holding five of the ten behind
// fragments 01–04, 06, 12–14, 16 and 17 completes the Unscramble quest.
// Last file on purpose: stagehand feeds Trabolta only the first 24 codex entries.
// Nothing here comes from a hunt answer, a Trabolta secret, the patch combos,
// or anything the story reveals after hour two.

CODEX Jeeves Fragment 01
  title: JEEVES.IDX — fragment 01
  text:
    Maps And Ducks is a `/website/ on Barrington Street whose neglected
    `/fundraiser/ advertises mapsandducks.com. Then the `/owners/ lapsed.
    Jean Trabolta registered it, because if there is a `/sign/ downtown
    everyone will think it is legit, and he evicted the real `/domain/ by
    citing the `/business/ as proof of ownership. Tonight is a special
    `/billboard/ party to restore the `/billboard/ at Maps And Ducks.

CODEX Jeeves Fragment 02
  title: JEEVES.IDX — fragment 02
  text:
    The `/duck/ on Barrington Street shows a `/pin/, a `/paint/, and a
    `/billboard/ that reads YOU'RE HERE (sic). Nobody has fixed it. The
    `/duck/ is peeling and the `/map/ is still smiling.

CODEX Jeeves Fragment 03
  title: JEEVES.IDX — fragment 03
  text:
    Halifax's first AI Data `/sinkhole/ was built on the site of the Halifax
    Explosion Memorial Pet `/Mayor/, over everyone's `/dawn/. At `/4 a.m./
    on opening day it fell into a `/Cemetery/. `/objections/ Randy Barkmore
    Jr. arrived hours early, at `/Centre/, and died in the `/sinkhole/.

CODEX Jeeves Fragment 04
  title: JEEVES.IDX — fragment 04
  text:
    The Halifax Explosion Memorial Pet `/gates/. When the `/candles/ chose
    it for the Data `/City/, Halifax protested: `/Cemetery/, `/City/,
    `/petitions/ at the `/Centre/. The `/vigils/ built it anyway.

